{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "FieldError": {
        "description": "``errors[]`` 的元素——422 欄位級明細（09 附錄 A：VALIDATION_FAILED）。",
        "properties": {
          "field": {
            "title": "Field",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "message": {
            "title": "Message",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "field",
          "message"
        ],
        "title": "FieldError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "LoginIn": {
        "description": "登入請求。\n\n``tenant_slug`` 是必填的，因為登入發生在租戶身分存在**之前**：RLS 之下，\n沒有租戶就查不到任何使用者，而 email 只在租戶內唯一（05 §3.1）。\nslug → tenant_id 由不含 RLS 的目錄表解析（apps/identity/models.py 的\n`TenantDirectory` 有完整說明）。\n\n未來改成子網域登入時，這個欄位改由 Host 標頭推導，契約可維持相容。",
        "properties": {
          "email": {
            "maxLength": 320,
            "minLength": 3,
            "title": "Email",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "password": {
            "maxLength": 1024,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Password",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "tenant_slug": {
            "maxLength": 63,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Tenant Slug",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "tenant_slug",
          "email",
          "password"
        ],
        "title": "LoginIn",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PasswordChangeIn": {
        "properties": {
          "current_password": {
            "maxLength": 1024,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Current Password",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "new_password": {
            "maxLength": 1024,
            "minLength": 8,
            "title": "New Password",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "current_password",
          "new_password"
        ],
        "title": "PasswordChangeIn",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ProblemDetail": {
        "description": "RFC 9457 §3.1 的成員 + 本專案的 extension member（§3.2 允許）。",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "09 附錄 A 的穩定錯誤碼；client 唯一該用來分支的值。無對應碼時省略",
            "title": "Code"
          },
          "detail": {
            "description": "這一次發生的情況；5xx 一律通用敘述，不含內部細節",
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "details": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "4xx 的補充資訊",
            "title": "Details"
          },
          "errors": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FieldError"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "422 的欄位級明細",
            "title": "Errors"
          },
          "request_id": {
            "description": "服務端產生的追蹤 id，與 X-Request-Id 標頭相同",
            "title": "Request Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "description": "HTTP 狀態碼，與回應行一致",
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "title": {
            "description": "錯誤類型的人類可讀摘要；同一 type 恆定",
            "title": "Title",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "description": "錯誤類型的 URI reference；無額外語意時為 about:blank",
            "title": "Type",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "type",
          "title",
          "status",
          "detail",
          "request_id"
        ],
        "title": "ProblemDetail",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "TenantOut": {
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "plan": {
            "title": "Plan",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "slug": {
            "title": "Slug",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name",
          "slug",
          "plan",
          "status"
        ],
        "title": "TenantOut",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "TenantUpdateIn": {
        "description": "本階段只開放改名稱。\n\n``slug`` 刻意不可改：它是登入的識別字，改掉等於所有既有的登入連結失效，\n而且 1A 沒有處理「舊 slug 導向新 slug」的機制。``plan`` 屬計費，2A 才有。",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "maxLength": 200,
                "minLength": 1,
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Name"
          }
        },
        "title": "TenantUpdateIn",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "TokenPairOut": {
        "description": "**只有 access token**。refresh 走 httpOnly cookie，不進 body。\n\n放進 body 的話前端就得自己存，而 localStorage 是 XSS 的直接目標；httpOnly\n讓 JavaScript 完全讀不到它。",
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "title": "Access Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "expires_in": {
            "title": "Expires In",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "token_type": {
            "default": "Bearer",
            "title": "Token Type",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "access_token",
          "expires_in"
        ],
        "title": "TokenPairOut",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "UserCreateIn": {
        "properties": {
          "display_name": {
            "maxLength": 200,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Display Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "maxLength": 320,
            "minLength": 3,
            "title": "Email",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "password": {
            "maxLength": 1024,
            "minLength": 8,
            "title": "Password",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "role": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Role"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "email",
          "display_name",
          "password"
        ],
        "title": "UserCreateIn",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "UserListOut": {
        "description": "包一層 ``items`` 而不是直接回陣列。\n\n裸陣列的回應之後要加分頁資訊（total、cursor）時就是破壞性變更；包一層之後\n加欄位是相容的。09 §1 的分頁契約會在 1B 有大量資料的端點時落地。",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserOut"
            },
            "title": "Items",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items"
        ],
        "title": "UserListOut",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "UserOut": {
        "properties": {
          "display_name": {
            "title": "Display Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "title": "Email",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "roles": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "title": "Roles",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "status": {
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "email",
          "display_name",
          "status",
          "roles"
        ],
        "title": "UserOut",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "UserUpdateIn": {
        "properties": {
          "display_name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "maxLength": 200,
                "minLength": 1,
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Display Name"
          }
        },
        "title": "UserUpdateIn",
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
  },
  "info": {
    "title": "Lumina spike (ADR-001 bridge)",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
